\paragraph{Cross-model consistency.} DeepSeek-Coder shows the same direction (\cls{} $>$ \cwm{}) under single-seed constraints. DeepSeek \cls{} degradation ranges from ${\sim}$4\pp{} (s42, drop preprocessing) to ${\sim}$12\pp{} (s123, truncate preprocessing), reflecting preprocessing and checkpoint selection sensitivity (Table~\ref{tab:taxonomy}). Eval seq\_length differs between models (Appendix~\ref{app:threats}).

